# 归一化行尾，避免 shell 脚本在 Windows clone 后带 CRLF 而报 `$'\r': command not found`
* text=auto

*.sh          text eol=lf
*.py          text eol=lf
*.md          text eol=lf
*.json        text eol=lf
*.ps1         text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png         binary
*.jpg         binary
*.gif         binary
*.zip         binary
